  "details": "If you tag your root Avatar with EditorOnly, the SDK will pass null to OnPreprocessAvatar callbacks. This causes difficult-to-diagnose null reference exceptions in libraries like Poiyomi shaders.\n\nThe SDK should probably either ignore the EditorOnly tag on the root object, or show a nice error message.",
